  "method": "Multi-indicator parcel evaluation across 6 normalized dimensions: Productivity (P), Indicative Gross Crop Value (V), Water Security (W: canal proximity + GWPI + multi-year stability), Flood Exposure (F: Sentinel-1 Dec 2023 SAR change mapping + HAND), Market Access (M: OSM road MCP travel time), and Infrastructure (I). Decision taxonomy applied via strict rule hierarchy.",
  "limitations": "Crop value figures are indicative estimates based on published MSP and regional agronomic benchmarks (to verify with local mandi records). Priority category thresholds are rule-based, with \u00b110% sensitivity reported. The December 2023 flood footprint reflects a specific extreme precipitation event (~950 mm in 24h). Market travel time relies on OpenStreetMap road network completeness and nominal speed profiles.",
